[stderr] 
[stderr] The functional reference constrains high-level party-based turn-based adventure
[stderr] scope only. It is never permission to reproduce branding, names, copy, story,
[stderr] characters, lore, assets, music, layouts, screen composition, maps, distinctive
[stderr] menus, flows, or interaction choreography. Original mechanics expression,
[stderr] content, UI, art, and feedback must be created for this product.
