+## Product outcome and personas
 
-Mock Fantasy Quest 4 is an original, small, single-player 2D fantasy RPG for a responsive public web application and installable PWA. A player explores one town and one dungeon, completes a short quest chain, wins turn-based encounters, manages a small inventory, saves or resumes safely, and reaches a short ending. The first release is useful without sign-in, remote sync, multiplayer, purchases, live operations, analytics, seasonal content, or player-created content.
+The first release is successful when a casual or adult player can start the
+original 2D fantasy adventure, complete an understandable first battle, save,
+return later without losing confirmed progress, finish the single town and
+dungeon story, and reach its short ending offline after installation or a
+successful first asset download.
 
